%description:
Tests a spurious exit of HyStart++ (RFC 9406, slowStartExit = "hystartpp").
The client (Tcp, TcpNewReno with SACK) sends 2000000 bytes at t=1; the RTT is
4 ms, and the rounds of slow start bring 1, 2, 4, 8 and 16 ACKs. The tester
delays the 16 ACKs of the fifth round (B017 to B032) by 10 ms, so the minimum
RTT of that round, after 8 samples, is 14 ms, 4 ms (MIN_RTT_THRESH) or more
above the 4 ms of the round before: the client enters the conservative slow
start (CSS), with 14 ms as its baseline. Two rounds later, the minimum RTT of a
round falls to 4 ms, below the baseline: the exit was spurious, and slow start
resumes, with HyStart++.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

network = inet.test.moduletest.lib.TcpTestNet1

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.testing=true

*.tcptester.script="b17 delay 0.01; b18 delay 0.01; b19 delay 0.01; b20 delay 0.01; b21 delay 0.01; b22 delay 0.01; b23 delay 0.01; b24 delay 0.01; b25 delay 0.01; b26 delay 0.01; b27 delay 0.01; b28 delay 0.01; b29 delay 0.01; b30 delay 0.01; b31 delay 0.01; b32 delay 0.01"

*.cli_app.active=true
*.cli_app.localAddress="10.0.0.1"
*.cli_app.localPort=1000
*.cli_app.connectAddress="10.0.0.2"
*.cli_app.connectPort=2000
*.cli_app.tOpen=0s
*.cli_app.tSend=-1s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=0B
*.cli_app.sendScript="1 2000000"
*.cli_app.tClose=-1s

*.srv_app.active=false
*.srv_app.localAddress="10.0.0.2"
*.srv_app.localPort=2000
*.srv_app.connectAddress="10.0.0.1"
*.srv_app.connectPort=1000
*.srv_app.tOpen=0s
*.srv_app.tSend=-1s
*.srv_app.sendBytes=0B
*.srv_app.sendScript=""
*.srv_app.tClose=-1s

*.cli_tcp.conn-*.algorithm.slowStartExit = "hystartpp"
*.srv_app.statusRequestScript="1.5"
sim-time-limit = 3s

%contains: stdout
HyStart++: the minimum RTT of the round grew from 0.004 to 0.014, conservative slow start (CSS)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
HyStart++: the minimum RTT of the round fell to 0.004, below 0.014: the exit was spurious, slow start again
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%not-contains: stdout
rounds of CSS, congestion avoidance
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
